title: 'statement-store: drop benchmarks of store methods that no node calls'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    The statement store benchmarks cover only the store methods that a node calls. The benchmarks
    of statements, broadcasts, posted, statement and remove are removed, and the remaining reads go
    through the subscription snapshot. The read_scaling, contention and full-store numbers no
    longer compare with older baselines.
crates:
- name: sc-statement-store
  bump: none
